OL,3,AMatthew Rhys' sister 'so proud of him'
OL,4,Aafter historic Emmy wins
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe sister of Hollywood actor Matthew
OL,7,FRhys said her family had been "pinching
OL,8,Fourselves all week" following his
OL,9,Fhistoric Emmy success.
OL,11,FRhys became the first person to win two
OL,12,Flead acting Emmy prizes in one night,
OL,13,Fafter he was named best lead actor in a
OL,14,Flimited series for the psychological
OL,15,Fthriller The Beast In Me, and best lead
OL,16,Factor in a comedy for his role in
OL,17,FWidow's Bay.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
