OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AMatthew Rhys' sister 'so proud of him'
OL,4,Aafter historic Emmy wins
OL,5,
OL,6,FHis older sister Rachel Evans, who
OL,7,Faccompanied Rhys to the ceremony in Los
OL,8,FAngeles, said she was starstruck seeing
OL,9,FHollywood royalty at the event, and
OL,10,Frevealed that she and her brother
OL,11,Fcalled their parents afterwards, who
OL,12,Fwere sat at home in their dressing
OL,13,Fgowns.
OL,15,F"I think we just all giggled for a long
OL,16,Ftime."
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
